      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Drug-use data in a large university hospital have been used as a means for evaluating the influence of the recommendations given by a drug committee on the use of analgesics. The results generally show a reasonable adherence to the recommendations in the hospital. A selected clinic, the Department of Oncology, where special efforts were directed, showed particularly close adherence to the guidelines given."},
